            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145428,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir karşılaştırmanın sonucunu bir değişkende hangi operatör saklar?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\" iscode=\"false\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>=</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>===</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>&lt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145429,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir oyuncunun ifadenin sol tarafındaki <code>health</code> değerinin <code>0</code>'dan küçük veya eşit olup olmadığını kontrol etmek için hangi operatöre ihtiyacımız var?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&gt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145430,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karşılaştırmanın sonucunu <code>levelCleared</code> içinde sakla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"320\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minScore = \" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelCleared = score &gt;= minScore;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelCleared);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const</code>, ardından <code>levelCleared</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>score &gt;= minScore</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145431,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodun konsolda <code>true</code> görüntülemesini sağla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerLevel = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerLevel &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>5</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145432,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Büyük veya eşittir operatörünü kullanarak <code>score</code> değerinin <code>minScore</code> değerinden büyük ya da ona eşit olup olmadığını kontrol et.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minScore = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelCleared = score &gt;= minScore;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelCleared);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&gt;=</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145433,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Run&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;Run&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>RunRun</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>true</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
