            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Sword\"</code> ile <code>\"Shield\"</code>'ın eşit olmadığını kontrol et.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"23\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>!==</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
