            "id": 145439,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>101</code> değerini <code>const</code> değişkeni <code>totalScore</code>'a kaydet.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalScore = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const totalScore</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145440,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>message</code> hangi türe sahip?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Has key: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + hasKey;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dize</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Boolean</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sayı</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dize öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145441,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"1001\"</code> değerini <code>result</code> değişkenine kaydet.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"100\"</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145442,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Double jump enabled: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Double jump enabled: true\"</code> dizesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Boolean <code>true</code> değeri</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Double jump enabled: \"</code> dizesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Double jump enabled: true\"</code> dizesi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145443,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Oyuncular, <code>gameOver</code> değişkeni <code>true</code> olarak ayarlan<em>mamışsa</em> sonraki seviyeye geçebilir. Oyuncunun devam edip edemeyeceğini kontrol etmek için bir operatör kullan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameOver = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" canContinue = !gameOver; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Can continue? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + canContinue);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>!</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 145444,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>&amp;&amp;</code> ile <code>||</code> arasındaki fark nedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&amp;&amp;</code>, yalnızca tüm koşullar <code>true</code> olduğunda <code>true</code> döndürür; <code>||</code> ise en az bir koşul <code>true</code> olduğunda <code>true</code> döndürür</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&amp;&amp;</code> hiçbir zaman <code>true</code> döndürmezken <code>||</code> her zaman döndürür</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&amp;&amp;</code> hiçbir zaman <code>false</code> döndürmezken <code>||</code> her zaman döndürür</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&amp;&amp;</code>, yalnızca tüm koşullar <code>true</code> olduğunda <code>true</code> döndürür; <code>||</code> ise en az bir koşul <code>true</code> olduğunda <code>true</code> döndürür.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 145445,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"43\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shieldEnergy = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = (playerHealth &gt; \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") &amp;&amp; (shieldEnergy &gt; \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hata</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>false</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 145446,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Oyunun doğru şekilde çalışıp çalışmadığını kontrol et. FPS sabitse <em>veya</em> oyuncu aksaklık görmüyorsa oyun düzgün çalışıyor demektir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fpsStable = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" noGlitches = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = fpsStable || noGlitches; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game ok? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>fpsStable</code>, ardından <code>||</code> ve son olarak <code>noGlitches</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
