            "id": 145447,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Öğenin envanterde mevcut olup olmadığını kontrol et.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isSlotEmpty = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isAvailable = !isSlotEmpty; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isAvailable);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>!</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
